        Feature("species_sign", "Species Sign Decoder", "ID", "Turn droppings, tracks, sounds, and damage into a ranked species list.", listOf("Photograph droppings, tracks, and chew marks with a scale.", "Note time of activity (dusk, night, dawn, day).", "Record attic, crawl, chimney, soffit, or yard location.", "Compare size: rice-grain = bats/mice, marble = squirrel, grape = raccoon."), "Most likely: raccoon if grape-size latrine + torn fascia. Squirrel if daytime + walnut chew + 2-3 in holes. Bat if dusk fly-out + staining under ridge/soffit."),
