        Feature("ppe_selector", "PPE Selector", "Safety", "Pick PPE from the actual hazard, not habit.", listOf("Droppings / urine: P100 or N95, gloves, coveralls, eye protection.", "Live raccoon/skunk: bite-resistant gloves, face shield option.", "Attic fiberglass: long sleeves, knee pads, headlamp.", "Roof work: harness when pitch or height requires it."), "Histoplasmosis risk is real in attics. Never dry-sweep guano. Mist, bag, and ventilate."),
